{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"{\n  \"prompt\": \"Create a Minecraft builder reference sheet, landscape 3:2, crisp voxel style using vanilla Minecraft blocks only, plain light background, no characters or animals. Two views side by side: LEFT straight-on north front elevation, orthographic; RIGHT three-quarter view from northeast showing front, east side, rear workshop and garden, at the same block scale. Skilled human builder quality: real massing, depth, projections and recessed framed openings, verges, eaves, ridge, and sub-block stairs, slabs, fences, walls, trapdoors and lanterns. Keep both views consistent. Small view labels and discreet exact-id material callouts are welcome; avoid a large legend crowding the build.\\n\\nSite: A candle maker's home and shop in an English market town, its eaves to a cobbled street to the north. Site 26 blocks wide x 34 deep. Main house 13 wide x 11 deep, two storeys plus a 45-degree grey slate roof, ridge at 16 blocks and chimney to 19. Grey stone-brick plinth. Ground storey warm red brick with long-and-short stone quoins. Centered five-wide shop bay projects one block: dark-oak posts, three glass panes glowing with clusters of yellow and white candles, dark-oak fascia with shop sign. Dark-oak shop door with glazed transom to its left; separate family door with little stone hood to its right. Upper storey projects one block on upside-down dark-oak stair brackets, half-timbered near-black dark-oak posts and beams with off-white calcite daub, pair of windows above bay, diagonal braces in outer panels made from stepped vanilla timber components. Real 45-degree grey slate roof with dark-oak verges, slab ridge, two small street-facing gabled dormers. Red-brick chimney with dark band and smoking cap on east gable. West corner dark-oak bracket carries hanging sign with lit three-candle cluster at its tip.\\nBehind house: lower single-storey brick workshop 9 x 10 under own slate gable; second tall brick chimney at back gable with tall plume of campfire smoke from tallow-rendering hearth. Against workshop east side: open dark-oak lean-to sheltering candle drying racks and tallow barrels. Spruce picket fence encloses rear garden, row of exactly four beehives, bright flower bed, woodpile beside chimney, barrels and cauldron beside side gate, apple tree represented by oak_log and oak_leaves, dirt_path from side gate. Show yard clearly in right view without moving it in front of house. Smoke is vanilla campfire particles.\\n\\nUse this palette by exact Minecraft block ids:\\nwall: bricks, brick_stairs, brick_slab, brick_wall.\\nplinth: stone_bricks, mossy_stone_bricks, stone_brick_stairs, stone_brick_slab, stone_brick_wall.\\nframe: stripped_dark_oak_log, stripped_dark_oak_wood, dark_oak_stairs, calcite.\\ntrim: dark_oak_planks, dark_oak_slab, dark_oak_fence, dark_oak_trapdoor, dark_oak_wall_sign, dark_oak_hanging_sign, dark_oak_door, spruce_door, spruce_trapdoor, glass_pane.\\nroof: cobbled_deepslate, deepslate_tiles, polished_deepslate, cobbled_deepslate_stairs, cobbled_deepslate_slab, deepslate_tile_stairs, deepslate_tile_slab, polished_deepslate_stairs, polished_deepslate_slab, tuff_brick_stairs, tuff_brick_slab.\\nchimney: deepslate_bricks, brick_slab, campfire, hay_block.\\nground: cobblestone, gravel, polished_andesite, grass_block, coarse_dirt, podzol, dirt_path.\\nyard: spruce_fence, spruce_fence_gate, spruce_log, spruce_slab, barrel, cauldron, water_cauldron, beehive, oak_log, oak_leaves, sweet_berry_bush, dandelion, poppy, cornflower, oxeye_daisy, allium.\\nlight: candle, white_candle, yellow_candle, honeycomb_block, lantern, iron_chain.\\nAvailable functional and decorative objects: spruce_planks, oak_planks, white_carpet, white_bed, red_bed, bookshelf, lectern, grindstone, smoker, furnace, flower_pot, potted_poppy, potted_dandelion, decorated_pot, chest, crafting_table. Use these only where visible and appropriate; do not expose interiors by